{
  "_readme": [
    "Source definition for the Arctor OXI e16 scene. Build with:",
    "  node e16-config/generate-scene.js e16-config/arctor.json 'e16 templates/arctor.oxie16'",
    "",
    "One e16 page per Arctor Param Control page (Osc / VCF / LFO / VCA / FX), laid",
    "out 4-wide in the SAME row-major order as the on-device knob grid, so a knob",
    "sits where its cell does on the OLED. Gaps are deliberate: they reproduce the",
    "device's section breaks (e.g. LFO row 1 is the LFO itself, row 2 its shared",
    "destinations, row 3 the two per-oscillator tremolos).",
    "",
    "Every CC and every `default` is copied from the PARAMS table in",
    "sketches/arctor.py -- pushing a knob sends its INIT value, so a push resets",
    "the parameter to exactly what a fresh patch has. `bipolar` marks the six",
    "center-at-64 parameters (both osc tunings, filter env amount, the three EQ",
    "bands) so the e16 draws a center-anchored ring and reads -63..+64.",
    "",
    "`mode` 9 = 3 CC values per detent, MEASURED on hardware as the largest step",
    "the e16 will send: modes 0-2 are slower than 1 CC/detent, 3-7 are acceleration",
    "(1 per detent until you turn fast), 8 steps by 2, 9 by 3, and 10 is ignored and",
    "falls back to 1 -- so the published LSp2/LSp4/LSp6 = 2x/4x/6x table is wrong.",
    "Set on the parameters Arctor reads as a handful of discrete buckets (waves 21",
    "CCs/bucket, filter type and both envelope shapes 32 CCs/bucket): 3 is well",
    "under the 21-CC narrowest bucket, so no bucket can be stepped over from any",
    "starting value, it just takes ~7 detents per wave instead of 21. `mode` 5 =",
    "Acc2 on the two osc tunings: their map is wide octave/fifth bands around narrow",
    "+/-35-cent detune wings, so slow turns still land on single cents while a fast",
    "turn crosses an octave.",
    "",
    "Channel 12 is set once per page; every action inherits it (channel 0 = 'use",
    "page'). Page output 0 = ALL e16 outputs (TRS1/TRS2/USB/BLE); every action",
    "inherits that too (output 12 = 'use page')."
  ],
